  <div class="page-wrap">
    <div class="learn-layout">
      <nav class="toc">
        <div class="toc-label">On this page</div>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#evolution">The Evolution of Identity</a></li>
          <li><a href="#pseudo-auth">The Pseudo-Authentication Problem</a></li>
          <li><a href="#what-is">What is OpenID Connect?</a></li>
          <li><a href="#saml-vs-oidc">SAML 2.0 vs OIDC vs OAuth 2.0</a></li>
          <li><a href="#actors">OIDC Actors</a></li>
          <li><a href="#id-token">The ID Token Anatomy</a></li>
          <li><a href="#at-hash">Cryptographic Hash Bindings (at_hash &amp; c_hash)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#scopes-claims">14 Standard Profile Claims</a></li>
          <li><a href="#claim-routing">Where Do Claims Go? (ID Token vs /userinfo)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#discovery">Dynamic Discovery &amp; BYOI Federation</a></li>
          <li><a href="#execution-flow">5-Step OIDC Execution Flow</a></li>
